### API smoke tests — run after `dotnet run` with the http profile.
### Replace {{token}} with a Supabase access token whose app_metadata.roles
### includes "editor" or "admin" to exercise the write endpoints.
### Slugs/ids contain Arabic: percent-encode them in the URL (browsers and
### HTTP clients do this for you; a raw UTF-8 request line is rejected).

@base = http://localhost:5092
@token = PASTE_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{base}}/openapi/v1.json

### Listings
GET {{base}}/api/content?page=1&pageSize=12&sort=newest

### Books only, by title (culture-aware Arabic sort)
GET {{base}}/api/content?type=book&sort=title

### Per-type counts for the library tabs
GET {{base}}/api/content/counts

### Detail, addressed like the frontend routes
GET {{base}}/api/content/book/example-slug

### Categories
GET {{base}}/api/categories

### Create (requires editor/admin token)
POST {{base}}/api/content
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "article",
  "title": "اختبار",
  "description": "سجل تجريبي للاختبار",
  "categoryIds": ["aqeedah"],
  "tags": ["test"],
  "rightsStatus": "external",
  "sourceUrl": "https://example.com/article"
}

### Delete (requires editor/admin token)
DELETE {{base}}/api/content/SOME_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
